{"seq":2,"slug":"rate","title":"率函数：大偏差理论的核心对象","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/rate","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rate-function","title":"率函数与好性质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/rate/rate-function","wordCount":1719,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"cramer-theorem","title":"Cramér 定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/rate/cramer-theorem","wordCount":1465,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"legendre-transform","title":"Legendre 变换与凸对偶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/rate/legendre-transform","wordCount":1525,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"率函数-大偏差理论的核心对象\">率函数：大偏差理论的核心对象</h1><p>如果说基础章告诉我们稀有事件概率长得像 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-nI(x)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，那么这个指数里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 就是整门理论的主角。率函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量化了&quot;取值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 有多不自然&quot;：它在典型值处为零，离得越远数值越大，衰减也越快。理解率函数的性质、以及如何为具体模型算出它，是从&quot;知道有个衰减率&quot;到&quot;能用它做事&quot;的分水岭。</p>\n<p>三篇文档构成一条从抽象到构造的路径。<a href=\"rate-function\">率函数与好性质</a> 剖析 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 本身：为什么它必须下半连续、什么叫好率函数（水平集紧致）、零点为何对应大数定律的极限、以及凸性从何而来。<a href=\"cramer-theorem\">Cramér 定理</a> 给出第一个真正能算的 LDP——独立同分布随机变量之和的率函数，恰是其对数矩母函数的 Legendre 变换，这也是整门理论的历史起点（Cramér, 1938）。<a href=\"legendre-transform\">Legendre 变换与凸对偶</a> 单独把这个反复出现的变换讲透：它的几何含义、凸对偶的自反性、以及为什么&quot;矩母函数 ↔ 率函数&quot;这对偶关系会在 Cramér、Gärtner-Ellis、统计物理中一再登场。</p>\n<p>本章处在承上启下的位置：它把基础章的定义变成可计算的对象，又为原理章的三大定理准备好共同的语言。特别地，Legendre 变换一篇是全 hub 的技术枢纽——第三章的 Gärtner-Ellis 定理和第四章的自由能，本质上都是同一个变换换了身衣裳。建议读者在此章多花时间，把 Legendre 变换算到形成肌肉记忆。</p>\n"}